--- !u!114 &2023707344181429463
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3794775192171156028}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3890ed6113a7dec4b9c20bf199a79ab6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCBase
  NPC: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5d33e5e46cb3494459cc071285957c2b, type: 2}
  nameNPC: 
  type: 0
  newDialogue:
  - topic: Initial Intro pt.1 "Game Start"
    dialogueText:
    - Welcome aboard.
    - 'WARNING: the ship has been infested with alien parasites, all power systems
      are failing.'
    dialogueClip:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8277b26a8f016f143b6e53ed131d2e70, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6a1209bf8174f6b438647659a43635b0, type: 3}
    completedTopic: 0
    completedPrerequisite: 0
    isQuest: 0
    questInfo: {fileID: 0}
    quest:
      description: 
      prerequisite:
        name: 
        id: 0
        level: 0
        currencyReward: 0
        complete: 0
  - topic: 'Initial Intro pt.2 "Short introduction" '
    dialogueText:
    - I am the super computer and manager of this colony vessel.
    - We must regain control by extinguishing the immediate threat and restoring
      power to the ships main systems.
    - Please allow me to be your guide, I can direct you to this ships main pieces
      of infrastructure.
    - Scanning............. It seems you're an engineer - bummer.
    - Your current odds of survival seem to be 0.0001% according to your genetic
      pool.
    - Provided that you have absolutely zero combat capabilities, you will need to
      undergo cybernetic recomposition.
    - Aquiring immense firepower and cybernetic upgrades is imperative to allow for
      a fighting chance.
    dialogueClip:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9c47570c8316e6645ab1f21d31d6aca8, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4ec42d02fe04fee41a948a1fd32803b4, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    completedTopic: 0
    completedPrerequisite: 0
    isQuest: 0
    questInfo: {fileID: 0}
    quest:
      description: 
      prerequisite:
        name: 
        id: 0
        level: 0
        currencyReward: 0
        complete: 0
  - topic: Tutorial pt.1  "Move around"
    dialogueText:
    - First, let's make sure you're up to the task.
    - Use WASD to move.
    dialogueClip:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1e44bd18108db5f4aa489fea210e7454, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2d04a67487f537341a05511c09590d00, type: 3}
    completedTopic: 0
    completedPrerequisite: 0
    isQuest: 1
    questInfo: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0256515efc6dad345a6446a9a63bc547, type: 2}
    quest:
      description: 
      prerequisite:
        name: 
        id: 0
        level: 0
        currencyReward: 0
        complete: 0
  - topic: "Tutorial/FirstQuest pt.2 \u201CPickup starter weapon\u201D "
    dialogueText:
    - Great, you know how to move.
    - Now, its important you have a weapon. Grab the Dusty Pistol close by - it was
      dropped by a deceased security bot.
    - Weapons will be temporarily be upgradeable throughout an infested clear, make
      sure to choose the correct ones as the released energy from your weapon with
      alert more enemies.
    - Weapons must be overcharged using its internal battery to pierce the hard shell
      of the enemy, these batteries hold a large amount of energy.
    - The heat from an overcharged weapon could cause a catastrophic explosion, therefore
      they must be disposed of after each successful infested room clear.
    dialogueClip:
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    completedTopic: 0
    completedPrerequisite: 0
    isQuest: 1
    questInfo: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 704b6a4577e8ff94e88fb47ec5987a6d, type: 2}
    quest:
      description: 
      prerequisite:
        name: 
        id: 0
        level: 0
        currencyReward: 0
        complete: 0
  - topic: "Tutorial/FirstQuest pt.3 \u201COpen inventory\u201D"
    dialogueText:
    - Now that you have a weapon, you will need to equip it.
    - Open your inventory by pressing I, from there make sure to equip the Dusty
      Pistol into your loadout.
    dialogueClip:
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    completedTopic: 0
    completedPrerequisite: 0
    isQuest: 1
    questInfo: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 161d1b53ced894347881a92057d2ab80, type: 2}
    quest:
      description: 
      prerequisite:
        name: 
        id: 0
        level: 0
        currencyReward: 0
        complete: 0
  - topic: "Tutorial/FirstQuest pt.4 \u201COpen location device\u201D"
    dialogueText:
    - I will soon send you the location of the weapons research and manufacturing
      room.
    - Open your location device by pressing M, there you will see the location for
      active quests there.
    - (No location device yet)
    dialogueClip:
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    completedTopic: 0
    completedPrerequisite: 0
    isQuest: 0
    questInfo: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6cd8a4ee977706641926611fbcb161e8, type: 2}
    quest:
      description: 
      prerequisite:
        name: 
        id: 0
        level: 0
        currencyReward: 0
        complete: 0
  - topic: "Tutorial/FirstQuest pt.5 \u201CGain access to the Weapons Manufacturer
      room\u201D"
    dialogueText:
    - Processing positional data...
    - The location has been sent.
    - Make your way to the location, be careful as you will encounter enemies in
      mass.
    - Ensure to bring back plenty of specimens after disposing of the enemy!
    dialogueClip:
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    completedTopic: 0
    completedPrerequisite: 0
    isQuest: 1
    questInfo: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f8cf432609f6d1b4dbca306e15917ece, type: 2}
    quest:
      description: 
      prerequisite:
        name: 
        id: 0
        level: 0
        currencyReward: 0
        complete: 0
  - topic: Tutorial pt.6 (Recieve currency reward)
    dialogueText:
    - Perfect, you made it back alive!
    - Heres a currency reward for your efforts, you can use currency to research
      and buy new weapons and upgrades.
    - You would have aquired some useful specimen parts, we should take a look and
      see what you got!
    dialogueClip:
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    completedTopic: 0
    completedPrerequisite: 0
    isQuest: 0
    questInfo: {fileID: 0}
    quest:
      description: 
      prerequisite:
        name: 
        id: 0
        level: 0
        currencyReward: 0
        complete: 0
  - topic: "Tutorial/FirstQuest pt.7 \u201CCraft a weapon\u201D"
    dialogueText:
    - You may be able to use what you've earned to unlock a new weapon type.
    - Either way, you've disposed of your previous weapon and will need a new one.
    - The Dusty Pistol is easy to make although very unstable, therefore you can
      only hold one at a time at zero cost.
    - Go to the weapons room and interact with the crafting unit.
    dialogueClip:
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    completedTopic: 0
    completedPrerequisite: 0
    isQuest: 1
    questInfo: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7b97ee7ee0819044c9fb6e0de4f6a66f, type: 2}
    quest:
      description: 
      prerequisite:
        name: 
        id: 0
        level: 0
        currencyReward: 0
        complete: 0
  - topic: Tutorial pt.8 "Random infested clears"
    dialogueText:
    - If you happen to run low on specimens at any point, feel free to clear rooms
      that are accessible.
    - Rooms with low power sources house fewer enemies, as they're attracted to energy
      as a food source.
    - Rooms that are accessible and infested can randomly be found, and can be entered
      as long as they're not a quest room.
    dialogueClip:
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    completedTopic: 0
    completedPrerequisite: 0
    isQuest: 0
    questInfo: {fileID: 0}
    quest:
      description: 
      prerequisite:
        name: 
        id: 0
        level: 0
        currencyReward: 0
        complete: 0
  - topic: 'Quest pt.1 "Turn on the local powergrid" '
    dialogueText:
    - Lets see if we can turn on the local powergrid.
    - Make your way to the local generator and attempt to turn on the power.
    - My sensors have scanned a larger mass than what you have previously encountered,
      stay on your toes.
    - Don't worry, if you fail i'll make sure to send a security bot to retrieve
      you.
    dialogueClip:
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    completedTopic: 0
    completedPrerequisite: 0
    isQuest: 1
    questInfo: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2092648cb4bd6c04f9d064dc30a07293, type: 2}
    quest:
      description: 
      prerequisite:
        name: 
        id: 0
        level: 0
        currencyReward: 0
        complete: 0
  - topic: Playable prototype end "End of prototype"
    dialogueText:
    - This is the end of the current prototype, thank you for playing :)
    - Please feel free to give us constructive feedback, anything is valuable.
    dialogueClip:
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    completedTopic: 0
    completedPrerequisite: 0
    isQuest: 0
    questInfo: {fileID: 0}
    quest:
      description: 
      prerequisite:
        name: 
        id: 0
        level: 0
        currencyReward: 0
        complete: 0
